  message: "Audit-findings 0013 (Symbol.kind Cluster D — Framework Roles) filed in PR #3571 (commit 92c4ec781), closing the verdict-table layer of this item. 29 in-scope values FOLD: 27 to function/method, 1 (service) to interface, 1 (selector_ref) to reference. abi_call excluded per audit-findings 0010 sub-case (a). 8 values ship at PRELIM_RESOLVED (registry placeholders with no producers); 21 at UNRESOLVED (producers active). Producer migration ships piecewise as per-framework Wave 5 sub-PRs, paired with the parallel ADR-0028 Cluster C framework_dispatch fold (audit-findings 0014) per the WI-runod schedule. Item stays todo_hard until producer migration ships across all framework families."  # f2c0
