  message: "Wave 5 PR #1 of 6 merged in PR #3572 (commit 2e4721c59). Symbol.kind framework_role producers folded for: websocket.py (websocket_endpoint → function), tauri_ipc.py (ipc_publisher, ipc_caller, event_publisher, event_subscriber → function), openapi.py (openapi_operation → function). gRPC route Symbol.kind held for PR #6 (route consumer-coupled with ~13 production consumers across linkers/cli/language analyzers). Five remaining PRs (per the user's 6-PR plan): PR #2 GraphQL/HTTP/Crypto/IPC/ObjC; PR #3 generic event/dispatch + Go-specific; PR #4 Ruby/Django; PR #5 single-row dispatch modules batched; PR #6 route Symbol.kind sweep + consumers. Item stays todo_hard."  # 9fe7
